Z||000018||Fiero*101||10-14-2001||11:43 PM||||Im 18 and this is my first car not my first auto mobile but my first car.<BR>and it was gift from god. Parents went half w/ me on it. the guy was asking 750.00 and i had like a grand saved up so my mom and dad went half w/ me so i could pay for insurance and to get it road worthy and to put some money in it b/c it was a nasty car when i first brought it home. BUT I LOVE MY CAR! still needs some work but other then that ive done all the work my self and its a learning experince it took alot of patince to work on it so i say yeah the Fiero is a great first car but im also for what was said earlyer Be Careful i dont know how many times i was speeding and didnt even know it till i look down and im doing 70 MPH!!! But all in all there a good expernce and fun to drvie<BR>sorry so long and im sure i misspelled somthing up there  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6||||reg||1
Z||000019||FieroRyan||10-14-2001||11:52 PM||||I'm 16.  My first car was (is) a Fiero.  Still have it, still love it, although I am eagerly awaiting this summer to get rid of the puny l4 and drop in a v8  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>P.S.  Note of warning, once you get one, don't plan on investing in anything else for a long while...||||reg||1
Z||000020||SKIDMARK||10-15-2001||01:40 AM||||There's some really good things about having a Fiero for a first car. No back seat for all your buddies to distract you from. No back seat for your girlfriend to distract you from. It's a cool looking car that most kids like. Insurance isn't as bad as a Camaro or Mustang. They have a good safety record. If you get one for your first car, you'll be joining a great group of people across America and Canada. And you already have a support group if things go wrong!<P>My 85 coupe is intended for my 16 year old son when he can afford the insurance. He thinks it's a great first car.<P>------------------<BR>White '85 4cyl coupe<BR>Black '86 v-6 SE<BR>'81 CB900F Super Sport||||reg||1
Z||000021||batt||10-15-2001||01:53 AM||||no back seat for my girlsfreidn..hmm....perhaps fieros arent right for me..is there a mod for that? perhaps a fold-a-bed? j/k ||||reg||1
Z||000022||htiek||10-15-2001||09:53 AM||||My fiero is actually my 3rd car.  Im 18 and my first car was an 83 Oldsmobile delta 88 royal.  My second car was a honda accord, which wasnt bad, with 260,000 when I got it, to 280,000 now and still running strong hondas are good investments for your first car.  <BR>Before I bought my Fiero I thought that the Delta 88 was the best car ever, I still wish it was around, being my first car and all.  My new fiero however is a lot more fun to drive and I wouldnt trade it for anything.  Well except for a newer Fiero.<P>Fiero's are great cars, no matter what number car it is, youll love it.||||reg||1
